	(text "Footprint only (no BOM part), TOP side under the\nOLED glass (SPEC section 8).\nKeep the 3 NPTH holes + cable-head area clear.\nNo series parts on SWD. NRESET: internal pull-up,\nR11 is a DNP option."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 127 166.37 0)
		(effects
